{
  "id": 8867178610887,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 01",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-01",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we understand the passion for baseball, and this personalized comforter set is designed for every baseball player, fan, and lover. It's not just bedding; it's a statement of determination and love for the game, crafted to bring comfort and style to any bedroom.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Perfect for baseball enthusiasts, offering a personalized touch for men, women, moms, and dads on special occasions like Valentine's, Mother's, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features two text input fields for custom personalization, allowing you to create a unique bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric, known for its softness, comfort, durability, and lightweight feel, ensuring a cozy night's sleep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Construction:</strong> Features whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping or shifting, ensuring longevity. The finishing process uses environmental protection techniques to prevent fading and maintain vibrant colors.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and dries quickly. It is recommended to air dry without heat or use a mesh laundry bag for best results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, perfect for a complete bedding refresh.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Baseball and Flag Series 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
